OL,3,GNEWSASale of derelict council-owned
OL,4,Afarm could raise #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA derelict farm could be sold off
OL,7,Fbecause the council that owns it cannot
OL,8,Fafford to bring it back into use.
OL,10,FVacant barns at Hicks Farm in Throop,
OL,11,FDorset, have been fenced off for a
OL,12,Fdecade because they are unsafe, and the
OL,13,Ftenanted farmhouse requires more than
OL,14,F#60,000 of repairs.
OL,16,FBournemouth Christchurch and Poole
OL,17,FCouncil (BCP) says it cannot fund the
OL,18,Frestoration of the listed buildings
OL,19,Ffrom its own budget but selling the
OL,20,Ffarm would raise about #1m.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
